      "language": "zh",
      "text": "车站在书店旁边。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-2-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.4,
      "sha256": "15fdeb6d35e9ccee4c54a60484de37dd6fd8790ea5a15c06b029d9cfaf1bf175"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-3-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กรุณาวางจดหมายไว้บนโต๊ะ",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-3-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.928,
      "sha256": "b50bb457636b0997cfa3cb29a724485e0fe29c2841ab6950440b18b46b27ac57"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-3-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "请把信放在桌上。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-3-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.328,
      "sha256": "b30aff26c93ce6e7bc7153371d81040f149c822c477d80fbcdf1d2137513487f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-4-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ทางนี้ไปถึงท่าเรือไหม",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-4-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.664,
      "sha256": "919b288b19c59077d17a6e9b76259f72fe10aec4138b84caac58ace14f5959fe"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-4-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "这条路能到码头吗？",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-4-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.376,
      "sha256": "88d23c8c8257653ecedea5f7e13f794bd393562e7e9207840898c1c3f7d85ef4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-5-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "พวกเรารอคุณอยู่ที่ประตู",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-5-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.88,
      "sha256": "9a2e64f7993963b3a370d62b30c8663c2bd93032145ddeb8cbaab6dc53b899f2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-5-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我们在门口等你。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-5-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.136,
      "sha256": "45ce2b00d422fe668bad8b4fe1bb3ead32d20243c45464066dbe3c6dfe7f877f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-6-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กรุณาเปิดหน้าต่างก่อน",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-6-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.712,
      "sha256": "f2930ea3acda1eae60970f4ce093944fc6b5499a17c6d0eb9758a76e69124260"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-6-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "请先打开窗户。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-6-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.112,
      "sha256": "b0b2977f97a713a9f04ac7549583b9315d9930cde34160f739a19e786600ae65"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-7-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ตอนกลับอย่าลืมเอาร่มไปด้วย",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-7-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.784,
      "sha256": "3e7e187255de360388ca9c67269320e2417388b36c80b12b1217497648655967"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3-7-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "回去的时候别忘了带伞。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a3-7-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.856,
      "sha256": "41fb24116a34829f1043e80851d09eb758248270538eaa42e8c030efeca6a1d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-0-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "พรุ่งนี้บ่ายเราพบกันที่สะพาน",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-0-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.976,
      "sha256": "088be2dce4534d94f47c1b53345ec9eb082fad878d4ba3a8bbc99f8aaf45de02"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-0-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我们明天下午在桥边见。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-0-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.76,
      "sha256": "58df37b558d1bee91ce954fa2f6fcaa2581ec589e4eaf9c9363df6fc7e28da1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-1-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ฉันส่งจดหมายให้คนขับเรือแล้ว",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-1-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.24,
      "sha256": "b553a7bc03a203059b8429ee4b7ff722dfb3e88806852b592326b321c4bcabea"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-1-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我已经把信交给船夫了。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-1-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.592,
      "sha256": "6b522f1b78697bf50c1d78fa17dc047c2891636aeab74b6a4662bb2570fa4aa1"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-2-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เมื่อวานเธอไม่ได้มาห้องสมุด",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-2-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.736,
      "sha256": "f3296e4e364027d18d840f8ffc36b391a5e68ea91db068566ff71819bfadca47"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-2-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "她昨天没有来图书馆。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-2-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.472,
      "sha256": "1cf948dfacebfaa64f877daccffc01a0c71db6a1385219256e1375baa82c3657"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-3-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กินข้าวเสร็จแล้วเราไปร้านหนังสือด้วยกัน",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-3-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.288,
      "sha256": "1a163c711eaf6f747e87df774c76590a4a343ddc19e4062dbfb9996826f94195"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-3-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "吃完饭以后，我们一起去书店。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-3-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.144,
      "sha256": "001e1b157067e064342371908f180d8944a628104eb07f9138170b388e2e9285"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-4-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "จดหมายฉบับนี้ส่งมาเมื่อสามวันก่อน",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-4-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "sha256": "9bf6c1e4f55d20726fcb847268bb15661b936f6f246bc7b40aea257fd68e3343"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-4-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "这封信是三天前寄来的。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-4-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.904,
      "sha256": "143e12963a429fd470275d3af406091fafb3a3091f6685fed333d2e534afc834"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-5-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ฉันยังหาหน้ากระดาษที่เธอทิ้งไว้ไม่เจอ",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-5-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.624,
      "sha256": "0db59f65a8b1045181b28ca06f3968a500c990dc62e419310f1439ca1b113d5e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-5-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我还没有找到她留下的纸页。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-5-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.832,
      "sha256": "68e5e136fc777f794289262c3de6d4c4fa9631757dd8a885de27413a37a5d2cf"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-6-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "รอฝนหยุดแล้วเราค่อยออกเดินทาง",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-6-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.192,
      "sha256": "d474c9b493dc020ce2f22914291e4c65936bf35cd602ca52dc611698f9837796"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-6-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "等雨停了，我们再出发。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-6-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.712,
      "sha256": "d952f7829570eebcbfea64218fb33bf9de1c6bd743351ebb2d1fa9eb3dafac9f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-7-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กรุณากลับมาก่อนสองทุ่ม",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-7-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.832,
      "sha256": "c36be2b27cb239f2b6df7d9b9e44c48f690cfaf65a949f1dcdec8e56ad234084"
    },
    {
      "id": "a4-7-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "请在晚上八点以前回来。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a4-7-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.712,
      "sha256": "822980e9c391799d5c4d7f433ac252790368e88d3962ef7fc677f4ef9e7bd871"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-0-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เพราะฝนตก วันนี้เรือจึงมาช้า",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-0-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.048,
      "sha256": "5ba80a5a9661f59ec327dfc40aa32e77c400af0ca30edd5ae909d06b17da16a7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-0-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "因为下雨，今天的船晚到了。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-0-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.12,
      "sha256": "f149e83d857987813b6c4ea058d3aea386482ab85a336621c1250dccd20f68d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-1-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ถ้าคุณฟังไม่ชัด คุณฟังอีกครั้งได้",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-1-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.288,
      "sha256": "57943eb0ebeaa226d7da475105774073b45daf65ab257107981028534f5005a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-1-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "如果你听不清楚，可以再听一次。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-1-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.336,
      "sha256": "23bced511558a2db63d5d57f9b389288a1fb31f9c3579ebbf99c888d247a6211"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-2-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "แม้ทางนี้จะไกล แต่ทิวทัศน์สวยมาก",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-2-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.36,
      "sha256": "698de10664ee85d0cd684ae8c59451397a6d104c7b0f874d177d3df9f25a3043"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-2-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "虽然这条路很远，但是风景很好。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-2-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.648,
      "sha256": "523ca161f60e49b6d61960fbd395d454be8a8d443c653c0cb4a507602bf64ed7"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-3-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ไม่ใช่ว่าฉันไม่อยากตอบ แต่ฉันยังคิดไม่ออก",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-3-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "sha256": "280952861b0ccdf9e22f7b7471ddc554b293f509839a30700c95eec6ffff104c"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-3-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我不是不想回答，只是还没想好。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-3-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.432,
      "sha256": "cdb2880c5e72a5b025c5e332f74e7d55f2c1577fa03dbae681298264f602c988"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-4-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "แค่เดินเลียบแม่น้ำไป ก็จะเจอสะพานนั้น",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-4-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.576,
      "sha256": "1668e88a5cf2644c918c949a25a211a9a34f899b452176e31c1d911ed156e493"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-4-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "只要沿着河走，就能找到那座桥。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-4-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "sha256": "4703c274301344cfde27fc1bcff528d6b7e49501891f93307ddafb7b5931e119"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-5-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "หนังสือเล่มนี้ง่ายกว่าเล่มนั้นนิดหน่อย",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-5-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.216,
      "sha256": "4554b404aa5121d290925a91abb23c7506ce36d8feea5b9b3f22c49c7d34312c"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-5-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "这本书比那本容易一些。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-5-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 2.736,
      "sha256": "0fbae8f846cdc7b73239afef3680fa952e9eea87e31791356d14e91c67d0d856"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-6-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กรุณาฟังฉันพูดให้จบก่อน แล้วค่อยบอกความคิดของคุณ",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-6-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.248,
      "sha256": "4456fa3f9715f640cced2d127a879a9121eed5e22cb9112275cc141285ba2a63"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-6-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "请先听我说完，再告诉我你的想法。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-6-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.768,
      "sha256": "3b084a49015b98ccc6db36a1ff2f866ed1282be362b6ab833a2ec34d2a756600"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-7-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เธอเขียนที่อยู่ลงบนกระดาษเพื่อไม่ให้ฉันลืม",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-7-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.768,
      "sha256": "89a5b850264f25f0451a50cd3a75ad68a8aa9d9c4536a8e2db77cfc2a4822827"
    },
    {
      "id": "a5-7-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "她把地址写在纸上，免得我忘记。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a5-7-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "sha256": "5419d44eb8d2bd809457447d401b79c694cf192c416835ef7a87ddc9ce709616"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-0-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ตอนแรกฉันคิดว่าเขาโกรธ แต่ภายหลังถึงรู้ว่าเขาแค่เหนื่อยมาก",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-0-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.584,
      "sha256": "31c010f6f4c7dd5cabe766cbdafe6d30db46b8124a9a60d7d4587d9d2429c3c2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-0-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "我原来以为他生气了，后来才知道他只是太累了。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-0-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.968,
      "sha256": "578b67e04e135b2a5c933e1adb784c61c2299cdec517c73c2508716d9aba538d"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-1-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ถ้าคุณยอมรอสักครู่ ฉันพาคุณไปร้านชาที่เธอไปบ่อยได้",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-1-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.416,
      "sha256": "d9e475e00582567d44834ace8ad09f7d78aeaf8e4f1593d8c8fceee1622cf03e"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-1-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "如果你愿意等一会儿，我可以带你去她常去的茶铺。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-1-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "sha256": "09b2d50e555fc5feb01043f52ec342d20ce77dfed216d61e1bcd67d95ee95f09"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-2-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "กรุณาบอกคนขับเรือว่าเราจะไปท่าเรือทางตะวันออกของสะพาน ไม่ใช่ทางตะวันตก",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-2-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 5.544,
      "sha256": "c7f9f67750360934b5f04535bc3d8842afe1c63f7915f9c93ed3718bfaf42ef6"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-2-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "请告诉船夫，我们要去的是桥东边的码头，不是西边的。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-2-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 5.328,
      "sha256": "2788ff6d5840f87afd87a5d3635264390e296102376c918d6ae20d747ab1bd0a"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-3-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "แทนที่จะรีบเดาคำตอบ ลองฟังให้จบทั้งประโยคก่อนดีกว่า",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-3-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.584,
      "sha256": "ca34c61afc9277d8dd83e9ee6339dcad3f39a3653ad69db21460a8af90dcae37"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-3-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "与其急着猜答案，不如先把整句话听完。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-3-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "sha256": "e8a419e9e9fb417416b82563a3d6ff23f8fbfceea0b3fada25240acf851c1e55"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-4-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ไม่ว่าตอนนี้เธอจะเดินทางไปถึงไหน ฉันก็จะส่งจดหมายฉบับนี้ให้ถึงมือเธอ",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-4-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 5.496,
      "sha256": "bb4024daa7de2b96fc3be12e50fbce786b0ee03027e8b9b89f653a7d70b93af4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-4-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "无论她现在走到了哪里，我都会把这封信送到她手里。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-4-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 5.232,
      "sha256": "7e6b1ed79d56eef712dc6f26a6450292f71586cea417ab62fb76d3c22632469c"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-5-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ตอนที่เขาพูด เขามองไปที่ประตูตลอด เหมือนกำลังรอคนสำคัญอยู่",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-5-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 4.944,
      "sha256": "fae9bd83b75030e9cd6ca85093bf7b2a0dda07ffd8fbaba4427ea4d28c9397e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6-5-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "他说话的时候一直看着门口，好像在等一个很重要的人。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a6-5-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 5.352,
      "sha256": "66eeae94f611c61249fb8ebdd4b71438475ef1654b621d71882c030097befe60"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-0-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เมื่อเราพบกันอีกครั้ง ฉันอยากใช้ภาษาของเธอค่อย ๆ เล่าเรื่องราวที่พบเจอตลอดทางให้เธอฟัง",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-0-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 6.312,
      "sha256": "3c9b68d6171e055fb354c54e4383e09543f7f285ecea53ea702c70e5169d671f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-0-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "等我们再次见面的时候，我想用你的语言，把这一路经历的故事慢慢讲给你听。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-0-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.128,
      "sha256": "e450009422692cb492a0e4ea6a40c1391f631ad8c02daa7c2c72bf86c2bf0eae"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-1-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "แม้ฉันยังพูดบางคำผิด แต่ตอนนี้ฉันถามทางด้วยตัวเองได้แล้ว และเข้าใจคำแนะนำที่คนอื่นให้ด้วย",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-1-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 6.384,
      "sha256": "eb9b87c2b4f8593a8632db596e58822b372c30dfb2237aa4ec0ea73ae4e71617"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-1-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "虽然我还会说错一些词，但现在我已经能够独自问路，也能听懂别人给我的建议了。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-1-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.704,
      "sha256": "2ee623f3d67316fa4674de90d73be1c7dde479dbc5f7bf80935a120af0ac020f"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-2-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ถ้าวันนั้นฉันไม่ได้หยุดฟังเรื่องของมันจนจบ บางทีจนถึงตอนนี้ฉันอาจยังคิดว่ามันเป็นแค่มอนสเตอร์ที่ขวางทาง",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-2-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.104,
      "sha256": "a39bf13c983eb9a1cce4c5d409684fdd1c3206b4a6886d4de32c82d795ac30b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-2-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "如果那天我没有停下来听完它的故事，也许直到现在，我还以为它只是一个挡路的怪物。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-2-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 8.448,
      "sha256": "3f444e93769d32894c435a42459709f8ae6e5a0af5e1b3b49b2c7b310bf8d582"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-3-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "ผู้คนในเมืองนี้พูดภาษาต่างกัน แต่ทุกคนต่างก็ใช้วิธีของตัวเองรักษาสัญญาที่ไม่อยากให้สูญหายไป",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-3-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.416,
      "sha256": "2418c3de48b372621f4847b51619a7bfa2155254c0f8e9a1fec673e880b7c0b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-3-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "这座城市里的人说着不同的语言，却都在用自己的方式，守护着一个不想失去的约定。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-3-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.92,
      "sha256": "f42829ab06ec713fb3b657ac9861a5f12e5d65c16fe38b8690439b12da87ac1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-4-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เธอไม่จำเป็นต้องเรียนรู้ทุกประโยคในครั้งเดียว แค่วันนี้เข้าใจมากกว่าเมื่อวานอีกนิด ระยะห่างระหว่างเราก็จะน้อยลงอีกหน่อย",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-4-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 7.536,
      "sha256": "b0acaa90cecf23ee77e5a4a43dc4c95b5fd27d14ce22148abde9a8cbc7176c04"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-4-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "你不必一下子学会所有的话，只要今天比昨天多听懂一点，我们之间的距离就会再近一点。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-4-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 8.136,
      "sha256": "d2b0b689f8638c9d45f9dc9d357eb2f031fae7f93a02b32da3a93113389fcc3c"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-5-th",
      "language": "th",
      "text": "เมื่อเสียงนาฬิกาดังขึ้นอีกครั้ง อย่าเพิ่งรีบวิ่งไปข้างหน้า ลองหันกลับไปดูก่อน คนที่รอเธออยู่มาตลอดอาจอยู่ที่อีกฝั่งของสะพาน",
      "voice": "th-TH-PremwadeeNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-5-th.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 8.112,
      "sha256": "41b2e4b9b05dcc4f3b313757d97248877d7cd5be4e6970e6055b22017b2bd2b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "a7-5-zh",
      "language": "zh",
      "text": "当钟声再次响起，请别急着向前跑，先回头看看，那个一直在等你的人也许就在桥的另一边。",
      "voice": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
      "file": "assets/voice/a7-5-zh.mp3",
      "ready": true,
      "duration": 8.712,
      "sha256": "a6b3cebefd14531ed98edb35fd92484a5f9c57195dc172fe6db2656f0ee3a664"
    }
  ],
  "ready": 120
}